sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Pres as Presenter
    participant HMI
    participant Eng as Simulation engine
    participant Plant as Virtual plant
    participant Twin as Digital twin
    participant Dash as Dashboard
    Pres->>HMI: Inject partial shading
    HMI->>Eng: Fault command
    Eng->>Plant: Apply fault
    Plant-->>Eng: Power drops
    Eng->>Twin: G, T, V, I
    Twin-->>Eng: Prediction unchanged, deviation rises
    Eng-->>HMI: WARNING, then ABNORMAL
    Eng-->>Dash: Event logged
    Pres->>HMI: Acknowledge alarm
